From: ROCKNIX beryllium port
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: beryllium: USB dual-role (otg) for controllers

The stock beryllium DT hardwires the USB port to "peripheral" (device only),
so USB host (game controllers, keyboards, hubs) never works. Switch to dual-role
"otg" so the port can act as host when a peripheral is attached while still
supporting device mode (gadget/charging) on a PC/charger.

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sdm845-xiaomi-beryllium-common.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sdm845-xiaomi-beryllium-common.dtsi
@@ -864,7 +864,7 @@
 };

 &usb_1_dwc3 {
-	dr_mode = "peripheral";
+	dr_mode = "otg";
 };

 &usb_1_hsphy {
